@file fixtures/hl.nw
@begin docs 0
@text # Highlighting sampler
@nl
@text 
@nl
@text Two roots in two languages. Each root pulls an abstract chunk in through a
@nl
@text hole, so the weaver colors both grammars *and* splices a chunk-use back
@nl
@text inside the coloring (SPEC.md §5.5). The language is resolved out of band from
@nl
@text each root's file extension — no per-chunk annotation.
@nl
@text 
@nl
@end docs 0
@begin code 1
@defn greeting
@nl
@text "hello from a literate program"
@nl
@end code 1
